    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Violated Princess</strong> \u2013 A Dark &amp; Lewd Survival Roguelike</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrown into a world of chaos, <strong>Princess Aurelia</strong> must fight for her survival against relentless waves of monstrous enemies, lecherous beasts, and sinister overlords. In this <strong>intense, action-packed roguelike</strong>, embrace the thrill of combat as you unlock devastating abilities, evolve your power, and claim your revenge\u2014or succumb to the dangers that await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632530/extras/915300d32ee65ccde3eb2a662d7e8547.poster.avif?t=1749745864\" width=602 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632530/extras/915300d32ee65ccde3eb2a662d7e8547.webm?t=1749745864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632530/extras/915300d32ee65ccde3eb2a662d7e8547.mp4?t=1749745864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a cursed kingdom overrun by unholy beasts and sinister nobles, the once-proud princess must fight for her survival\u2014or submit to the twisted fate awaiting her. <strong>Violated Princess</strong> is an intense, mature-themed roguelike survivor game where waves of relentless enemies threaten to consume both body and soul. Will you embrace the darkness and rise as a powerful warrior, or succumb to the corruption that hungers for you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632530/extras/4d3490e25cfc1831c68af3f8b3be1454.poster.avif?t=1749745864\" width=602 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632530/extras/4d3490e25cfc1831c68af3f8b3be1454.webm?t=1749745864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632530/extras/4d3490e25cfc1831c68af3f8b3be1454.mp4?t=1749745864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udde1 Features \ud83d\udde1</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>36 Devastating Abilities</strong> \u2013 Build your perfect arsenal with:<br>\u2726 <strong>12 Active Abilities</strong> \u2013 Unleash powerful attacks and spells<br>\u2726 <strong>12 Passive Abilities</strong> \u2013 Enhance your strength and resilience<br>\u2726 <strong>12 Evolutions</strong> \u2013 Upgrade abilities into their ultimate forms<br>\u2726 <strong>Customizable Stats</strong> \u2013 Fine-tune your abilities to suit your playstyle<br>\u2726 <strong>In-Game Ability Selector</strong> \u2013 Choose your path mid-run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632530/extras/60feb5123177a19f02cfaa311eb2a8b0.avif?t=1749745864\" width=602 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Customize Your Playstyle</strong> \u2013 Tweak and enhance <strong>ability stats</strong> to suit your strategy, whether you prefer raw destruction, tactical control, or high-risk, high-reward gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Dynamic Combat Effects</strong> \u2013 Every attack lights up the battlefield with <strong>stunning visual effects and handcrafted ability icons</strong>. Watch as your power grows with each kill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>In-Game Ability Selector</strong> \u2013 Choose wisely! Adapt your build mid-run, unlocking potent abilities that shape your princess\u2019s journey from helpless royalty to an unstoppable force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7f <strong>Brutal Enemies &amp; Bosses</strong><br>\u2726 <strong>14 Animated Foes</strong> \u2013 A mix of simple and ranged threats<br>\u2726 <strong>6 Deadly Bosses</strong> \u2013 Each with <strong>unique mechanics (15 total phases!)</strong><br>\u2726 <strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> \u2013 Dodge, strike, and conquer overwhelming odds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Loot, Level, and Survive</strong><br>\u2726 <strong>4 XP Gem Tiers</strong> \u2013 Collect experience to grow stronger<br>\u2726 <strong>Strategic Drops</strong> \u2013 <strong>Bombs, Magnets, Healing, Coins, and Treasure Chests</strong><br>\u2726 <strong>Permanent Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Unlock new strengths and <strong>carry power across runs</strong><br>\u2726 <strong>Upgrade System Includes</strong> \u2013 Revive, Armor, Damage, Healing, and Max Health</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc51 <strong>Dark Fantasy &amp; Lewd Undertones</strong> \u2013 Experience a world steeped in corruption, temptation, and dangerous beauty. Your choices determine whether you conquer the night\u2026 or are devoured by it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632530/extras/97a83542e81f48bce454c77a21592b88.avif?t=1749745864\" width=602 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd1e <strong>Mature Content Warning</strong><br>&quot;Violated Princess&quot; blends <strong>sensuality, danger, and dark fantasy</strong>, featuring adult themes, seductive visuals, and animated encounters. Enter a world where power is taken, pleasure is a weapon, and survival means embracing both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you strong enough to survive the night, or will you become just another violated soul in the princess\u2019s tragic tale?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Join the adventure now &amp; prepare to fight--of fall!</strong> \ud83d\udd25</p>",
